  "details": "- CVE-2026-17084: use the Unicode 3.2.0 codepoint attributes required by RFC 3454\n  for the stringprep B.2/B.3 mappings instead of the running interpreter's, so\n  IDNA 2003 encodes domain names consistently\n- CVE-2026-87910: skip the member in tarfile's link-extraction fallback when\n  either filter call returns None, instead of discarding the first call's result\n- CVE-2026-19672: normalize '..' components in tarfile member names so the tar\n  and data extraction filters no longer create intermediate directories outside\n  the destination\n- CVE-2026-12003: remove the VPATH-relative Modules/Setup.local build landmark\n  fallback from getpath, making pybuilddir.txt the sole source-tree indicator",
